EONS Developer Documentation v0.1
Overview

EONS (E) is a compliance-oriented digital asset standard designed to extend traditional fungible token functionality 
with governance, traceability, beneficiary management, and programmable actions.

Unlike conventional token standards that primarily focus on token transfers and approvals, EONS introduces native mechanisms for:

Asset tracing
Beneficiary allocation management
Emergency controls
Custom business actions
Controller-based governance
Compliance and audit support
EONS Standard Goals

The EONS ecosystem is designed around five principles:

Transferability

Assets can move between participants efficiently.

Traceability

Digital assets can be tracked throughout their lifecycle.

Governance

Authorized controllers can administer ecosystem functions.

Recoverability

Emergency controls exist for incident response.

Extensibility

Applications can register and execute custom actions.
